  "HMS Dreadnought launched in 1906.",
  "Her design had two revolutionary features including an all-big-gun armament scheme.",
  "She also used steam turbine propulsion.",
  "Similar battleships built after her were called dreadnoughts.",
  "Earlier battleships became known as pre-dreadnoughts.",
  "These new warships renewed the naval arms race between the United Kingdom and Germany.",
  "Most original dreadnoughts were scrapped after World War I."
